# Intentionally empty of database credentials.
#
# A mapped workspace database NEVER appears in a .env file. `solidactions env
# pull` writes a comment where APP_DB would be, explaining that its credentials
# resolve live at run time. Run the workflow with:
#
#   solidactions dev src/record-order.ts --env production
#
# and the CLI fetches your platform variables AND mints a short-lived database
# credential in memory for the run.
